<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-C OCT NET RISES TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-C OCT NET RISES TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.47 vs   1.36</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.63 vs   1.90</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.95 vs   1.80</p>
<p> Sales		   26.19 vs  22.85</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    18.66 vs  16.65</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	34.25 vs  26.76</p>
<p> Operating profit    35.59 vs  26.53</p>
<p> Sales		  267.34 vs 225.20</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Cieszyn</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
